        <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体">本页判断：结构体把相关的数据捆成一个整体；变量用点，指针用箭头。</span></p>
      </content>
    </shape>
